      intro x hx; left; contrapose! Npos with h; exact_mod_cast h ▸ mem_Ici.mp hx
    · apply continuous_id.continuousOn.log ?_ |>.abs
      intro x hx; simp only [id_eq]; contrapose! Npos with h; exact_mod_cast h ▸ mem_Ici.mp hx
